sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor / User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database
    actor Ad as Admin
    V->>F: Fill the Team-plan contact form
    F->>A: POST /api/contact (name, email, company?, seats?, message)
    A->>A: Validate + rate-limit (throttle:contact)
    A->>DB: Create contact_request (status = new, IP recorded)
    A-->>F: 201 "Our team will reply by e-mail"
    Note over Ad,DB: Later, in the admin console
    Ad->>A: GET /api/admin/contact-requests
    A->>DB: List requests (+ new count)
    A-->>Ad: Requests (new / handled)
    Ad->>A: PATCH /api/admin/contact-requests/{id} (handled)
    A->>DB: status = handled, handled_by, handled_at
    A->>DB: audit admin.contact_request_handled
    A-->>Ad: Updated request
